                    <li>Van Raemdonck, G. M. R. &amp; Urila, I. (2019). A Study in Options to Improve Aerodynamic Profile of Heavy-Duty Vehicles in Europe. <em>Sustainability</em>, 11(19), 5519. DOI: 10.3390/su11195519</li>
